## D10: Command-based agent configuration — 2026-02-02

**Context**: Need to determine how to configure different agents (dev, review, next-action)

**Question**: [Question not provided]

**Options Considered**:
[Options not provided]

**Decision**: Agents configured as shell commands with variable substitution (e.g., command = "claude -p '{{prompt}}'"). No provider abstraction - just specify the command to run.

