## D20: Review agent failure exits immediately — 2026-02-02

**Context**: What happens if review agent fails (non-zero exit or timeout)

**Question**: [Question not provided]

**Options Considered**:
[Options not provided]

**Decision**: Exit immediately with error - review agent is critical infrastructure, failure indicates setup problem not dev work problem

